    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Create and discover Custom Levels on the Steam Workshop!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Geomatrix, a digital realm where everything is a polygon, including you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, discover and share levels, compete for the best times and discover hidden secrets. Whether you're a triangle, circle or square, each shape has their own unique abilities that dictate how you solve puzzles and clear levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Features-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/5b8172e718e2923119dfc6364b8df1a7.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the in-game <strong>level editor</strong>, you can make all kinds of crazy creations from difficult time trials to complex contraptions! The level editor features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Various simple and complex shapes,</i></strong> that you can combine to create minimalist structures or huge open worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lots of functional blocks,</i></strong> such as the <i>automator</i> and <i>area trigger</i> for the engineers out there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many handy tools</i> <i>that streamline the creation process,</i></strong> like the camera zoom adjuster and background blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/bfae8eaf854a901340b095ba3cde6716.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend! Any of your maps can be uploaded to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> to allow them to be played in multiplayer!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Deep integration with Steam, </i></strong>use a lobby code or simply invite a friend through the Steam friends menu </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Compete with each other, </i></strong>for the fastest times and best scores, or work together to solve difficult puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cross-platform compatibility,</i> </strong>whether you're playing on a Windows or Mac system, anyone can join their friends, regardless of their operation system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/2e266e7ea495acafcb23cb8f1f115ca5.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not as interested in creating your own levels, or just want to experience some pre-packaged levels, I've got you covered!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A handful of demo levels,</i></strong> to preview the capabilities of the level editor and to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hidden collectibles and secrets,</strong></i> for the keen-eyed and curious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A subtle storyline</strong></i><strong>,</strong> of course, for the theorists out there</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Geomatrix, a digital realm where everything is a polygon, including you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, discover and share levels, compete for the best times and discover hidden secrets. Whether you're a triangle, circle or square, each shape has their own unique abilities that dictate how you solve puzzles and clear levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Features-</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/5b8172e718e2923119dfc6364b8df1a7.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the in-game <strong>level editor</strong>, you can make all kinds of crazy creations from difficult time trials to complex contraptions! The level editor features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Various simple and complex shapes,</i></strong> that you can combine to create minimalist structures or huge open worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lots of functional blocks,</i></strong> such as the <i>automator</i> and <i>area trigger</i> for the engineers out there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Many handy tools</i> <i>that streamline the creation process,</i></strong> like the camera zoom adjuster and background blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/bfae8eaf854a901340b095ba3cde6716.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend! Any of your maps can be uploaded to the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> to allow them to be played in multiplayer!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Deep integration with Steam, </i></strong>use a lobby code or simply invite a friend through the Steam friends menu </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Compete with each other, </i></strong>for the fastest times and best scores, or work together to solve difficult puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cross-platform compatibility,</i> </strong>whether you're playing on a Windows or Mac system, anyone can join their friends, regardless of their operation system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981580/extras/2e266e7ea495acafcb23cb8f1f115ca5.avif?t=1736206120\" width=720 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not as interested in creating your own levels, or just want to experience some pre-packaged levels, I've got you covered!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A handful of demo levels,</i></strong> to preview the capabilities of the level editor and to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hidden collectibles and secrets,</strong></i> for the keen-eyed and curious</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A subtle storyline</strong></i><strong>,</strong> of course, for the theorists out there</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Create, discover and share levels, compete for the best times and discover hidden secrets. In this sandbox platformer, whether you're a triangle, circle or square dictates how you solve puzzles and clear levels! Each shape has their own unique abilities that completely change the game.",
